    "long_instructions": "## Turn Your Flowchart into Pseudocode\r\n\r\nDownload either your **for loop** (Level 3) or **while loop** (Level 6) flowchart. Upload it to the AI chat with a prompt to turn your flowchart into pseudocode that represents a loop. \r\n\r\nPaste the pseudocode into the `documentation.md` file and make any necessary edits. Double check the AI output, making sure there are clear start, stop, and step values. ",
